description:
The node type is given. Write the functions in `solution.c`:

```c
typedef struct node {
    int value;
    struct node *next;
} Node;

bool push_front(Node **head, int value);
bool push_back(Node **head, int value);       /* walks to the end */
size_t length(const Node *head);
bool remove_value(Node **head, int value);    /* removes and frees the first node holding value */
void reverse(Node **head);                    /* reverses the links in place: no new nodes */
void free_list(Node **head);                  /* frees every node and sets *head to NULL */
```

